            <ArticleTitle>The diagnosis and treatment of interstitial cystitis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-7, 131</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Interstitial cystitis is a severe bladder disease of unknown etiology with no cure. The diagnosis and treatment of this difficult disease has frustrated both patients and clinicians alike. Multimodality therapy is the most effective treatment for interstitial cystitis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
